  "divisionUnitName": "Diviser par {number}",
  "@divisionUnitName": {
    "description": "Name of a unit of the division domain, shown on its node of the map, its detail, its Discovery page, the quiz, the help card and the Profile (\"Divide by 7\"). Short title. {number} is the divisor, from 1 to 12, the number of the multiplication table the unit reverses.",
