  "additionUnitName": "{unit, select, add5{Additions jusqu'à 5} sub5{Soustractions jusqu'à 5} add7{Additions jusqu'à 7} add9{Additions jusqu'à 9} toten{Compléter jusqu'à 10} sub7{Soustractions jusqu'à 7} sub9{Soustractions jusqu'à 9} subten{Soustractions à partir de 10} add12{Additions jusqu'à 12} add14{Additions jusqu'à 14} add20{Additions jusqu'à 20} sub12{Soustractions jusqu'à 12} sub14{Soustractions jusqu'à 14} sub20{Soustractions jusqu'à 20} add100{Additions sans retenue} sub100{Soustractions sans retenue} carry{Additions avec retenue} borrow{Soustractions avec retenue} other{}}",
  "@additionUnitName": {
    "description": "Name of a unit of the addition and subtraction domain, shown on its node of the map, its detail, its Discovery page, the quiz, the help card and the Profile (\"Additions up to 10\", \"Complete to 10\", \"Additions with carrying\"). Short title, a few words. {unit} is the slug of the unit (the end of its key), never shown: add5, sub5, add7, add9, toten, sub7, sub9, subten, add12, add14, add20, sub12, sub14, sub20, add100 (no carrying), sub100 (no borrowing), carry, borrow.",
    "placeholders": {
